**FIX**: clamp the crop's SIZE to the frame first, so the position clamp always has min <= max.

```rust
fn clamp(&self, crop: &mut Crop) {
    let Some((left, top, width, height)) = self.rect.get() else { return; };
    // The crop has to fit inside the frame, otherwise the bounds below
    // would have a maximum below its minimum.
    crop.width = crop.width.min(width);
    crop.height = crop.height.min(height);
    crop.x = crop.x.clamp(left, left + width - crop.width);
    crop.y = crop.y.clamp(top, top + height - crop.height);
}
```

